@name     var_from_data
@alias    =d
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_var_from_data
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  copy data array element to variable
@doc
Copies value from data buffer at index into variable register $var.
Usage: =d var index
@code
    return skode_exec_eqd(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
